      <activity id="b94a1115-5771-5903-b886-8115971790de" activityNameId="cc651b4a-89c4-5b74-9a3a-a631754c35ab" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Graphite, battery grade, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Graphite, battery grade, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of graphite battery grade. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process.;
UUID: 57d11a5a-f7de-367f-a6c8-0d60b655d830
Raw materials, machineries and energy consumption for production, estimated emissions to air from production and infrastructure of the site (approximation). No water emissions. The difference to the dataset "graphite, at plant" is the  input of hard coal coke (40 MJ) and electicity (1 kWh).
Location: It is assumed that the original dataset (graphite, at plant) can be used for chinese production. Chinese electricity mix is used.
Technology: Data approximated with data from lime mining, crushing and milling.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: approximation with data from literature, website, oral communication,  
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_57d11a5a-f7de-367f-a6c8-0d60b655d830.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
